WEBVTT

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:23.400
Everyone, I hope you are all well.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:24.370
This is Furuichi.

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:30.100
Summer vacation is finally here, and I have 
been released from that school full of delinquents.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.380
Currently, I have come to this 
tropical island with my family.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.520
Where's Oga, you ask?

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.880
Don't know, don't care.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:45.990
I'm sure you can do without all the 
pointless fights among delinquents, yes?

00:00:46.470 --> 00:00:50.490
Honestly, I had just about enough of it...

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:55.150
Hey, Bro! These girls said 
they also came from Tokyo!

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.800
I'm glad you've made some new friends.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:00.450
Kids should play toge...

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:12.560
And so, this episode, we'll 
change things up a bit.

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.850
Furuichi Takayuki, 15 years old...

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:15.670
Summer.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:19.170
An Adventurous Premonition of Romance...

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:22.680
Presented by myself, Furu...

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:27.690
This...

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:30.720
This...

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.070
<b>This big old guy</b>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:49.210
Dear Mom...

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.450
Oh, look who's here!

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:02.970
Let's head to the public pool!

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:07.500
Who needs friends, anyway?

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:11.930
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.050
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:17.910
But this baby is no ordinary baby...

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:20.140
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:05.970
<b>You're Not a Bad Specimen of a Man</b>

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.480
That's quite a crowd.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.940
Let me ask you again, Oga...

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:16.690
What kind of torture is this?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.860
What? Summer means going 
to the pool, you know?

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:22.900
Yeah, I'll agree to that.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:26.760
But I was poolside at a fancy resort.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:33.260
I was asking why <i>I</i> have to be crammed in like 
a can of sardines into this bug-infested pool?

00:04:34.210 --> 00:04:35.280
Huh?

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:36.880
'Cause it kinda pissed me off.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.720
Throwing straight balls at me, huh?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.130
And wait, do <i>you</i> enjoy this?

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:44.830
Well, you know...

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:48.390
As long as I can see your 
dejected face, I'm all good.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:51.530
What the hell is he saying?!

00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:54.770
I went to your house, but 
there wasn't anyone there.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:59.960
Furuichi-kun! Let's go out and play!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:03.280
Whatcha doin', big fellow?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:11.200
You see, Furuichi-dono and his family 
have all gone on vacation to a resort.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:14.070
And they have left me behind.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:18.790
I am now sitting here waiting 
for Furuichi-dono to return.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:26.600
See, this is why they call this 
a class-based society, Baby Beel.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:34.580
Well, the big guy seemed lonely, and 
I couldn't let you hog all the fun,

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.900
so I had him do a little job for me.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:45.340
Um... And you never considered coming 
to the resort yourself instead?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:47.670
What are you talking about?

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:48.700
That's just...

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.290
Just go somewhere and die...

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:05.970
How sad is it for two guys to 
take a baby to a public pool...

00:06:06.330 --> 00:06:08.680
If Hilda-san was here at least...

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:17.950
Chiaki, we got a table over here!

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:19.940
One just opened up!

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:26.110
Your're... Oga's lackey.

00:06:27.020 --> 00:06:29.610
God really exists, you know?

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.910
Wow! What a coincidence!

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:37.540
Yeah...

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.290
Sure...

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.420
And why is he sitting with us?

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:47.170
It looks like you're all here, 
but where's Kunieda-senpai?

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:52.050
Madame Aoi's been training ever 
since summer vacation started.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.300
Training?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.810
Could she be... A bride-in-training?!

00:06:55.810 --> 00:07:00.630
She said she wasn't good enough as she was 
now, and wanted to start over from square-one.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.650
And man, your reactions are just annoying.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.760
I see...

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.960
I wish I could have seen 
Ishiyama's Queen in a swimsuit.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.340
This bastard doesn't beat around the bush.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:29.090
I thought that just training all 
the time would be depressing...

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:32.220
We had to force her to come.

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.720
Then, she is here?

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.220
W-Where is she?

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:39.100
He sees a bush, he heads straight for it...

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:42.480
Well, we were together before.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:47.050
Anyway, weren't you with Oga?

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:48.020
Yeah.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:51.490
He took a shock, he's spaced 
out around here somewhere.

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:54.560
Tropical...

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.180
Tropical island...

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.210
Welcome!

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:01.250
Ha-ha... Aloha...

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:09.950
What'll I do?

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:12.760
I never thought he'd show 
up in a place like this!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.770
Isn't this swimsuit a little weird?

00:08:17.770 --> 00:08:19.680
It's my swimsuit from middle school...

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.770
Maybe it's too plain!

00:08:25.110 --> 00:08:27.290
So should I call him over?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.070
There's no need for that.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:36.620
I'd rather not see the guy who caused 
Madame Aoi to quit the Red Tails.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:40.180
Nene-san...

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:41.640
Scary...

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.740
I see.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:47.090
Well, so be it.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:51.260
Let's have fun chatting 
then, no Ogas allowed!

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.760
Are you even listening to me?

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:54.800
Sure.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:57.270
Would you like some ice-cream pops?

00:08:57.270 --> 00:09:00.130
There's a guy over there selling some.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:05.160
Oh, if it isn't Furuichi?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:10.370
It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.650
Those are guys from my middle school days...

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:16.100
Still chasing the girls, are you?

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:18.650
Introduce us, will ya?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.660
Four of us, and four of you. Perfect!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.460
Well, not including you!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:27.670
Friends of yours?

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.690
Well, he was an upperclassman 
in my middle school...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.090
Name is Takashima-san.

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:34.240
Hey, what's with that?

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.630
You can introduce me a little 
better than that, don't you think?

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:40.170
Like thanking me for the favor I did you...

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.220
You better watch out.

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:46.980
This guy's a womanizer to the core!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:51.190
Yeah! He looks at you and 
only thinks about sex!

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:54.630
Um... What's with these guys?

00:09:54.630 --> 00:09:56.700
They are really creeping me out.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.710
Ignore them, they're small-time.

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:04.030
Uh-oh, uh-oh!

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:07.330
You're in trouble when pervy 
Furuichi-kun's got his eyes on you!

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:10.670
Well, don't you worry.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:14.840
He won't go against us.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:20.600
Playing around with us is 
much more wholesome and fun.

00:10:20.980 --> 00:10:22.350
Look here, you guys...

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.390
Excuse! I need a swimsuit!

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.400
Yes? What kind of swimsuit?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.850
Whatever! A cute one!

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.220
With this, I'm sure...

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:08.260
Baby Beel, you know what?

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:11.080
Our summer is over, yeah...

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.800
Baby Beel, I ain't doin' anything today.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.700
Gonna take a nap.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:14.110
Aloha...

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:17.000
Aloha on a tropical island...

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:23.570
Welcome to a tropical island... Aloha...

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:31.650
You bastard...

00:12:31.650 --> 00:12:33.270
What are you trying, huh?

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.890
It's like an oven here, Senpai.

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.770
Did I cool your hot head?

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.280
Furuichi, you bastard!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.240
You wanna get the crap beat out of you?

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.010
Wait.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:48.160
Takashima-san!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.160
You haven't changed, Furuichi.

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:54.670
You still act all cool in front of girls.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:02.660
Don't tell me you forgot about the 
time that got you in deep shit, right?

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:07.520
What a piece of work I 
did on you back then...

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:15.040
You're pathetic.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:18.350
This is what happens when you 
act all tough in front of girls.

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:22.070
If you get it, then grovel 
and beg forgiveness.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:33.220
Did you hear me? I said grovel!

00:13:40.300 --> 00:13:41.710
Stop it, you...

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:53.280
Why, you...

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:55.040
What have you done to Takashima-san?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:56.880
You got nerve for a weakling!

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:59.310
We could beat you any time we wanted!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.130
Yeah, no kidding...

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:01.870
Ow!

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:03.820
Dang, headbutting hurts...

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:07.570
As you say, I'm seriously weak, so...

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:10.570
I'll run.

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.390
Adieu!

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.360
Damn him...

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:20.330
After him! Don't let him get away!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.710
R-Right!

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:23.820
Wait for us!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:28.300
This has gotten kind of serious.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:31.160
That Furuichi guy should 
have just let it go...

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.690
Oh?

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.810
Not a bad specimen of a man...

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:37.960
Yakisoba...

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.970
Is he over there?

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:42.480
He's underwater!

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.880
Damn it! There's even more people!

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.640
I can't find him like this!

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:51.360
That little shit thinks he 
can get the better of me?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.550
I'll find him and beat him good!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:56.860
Hey, it's me.

00:14:56.860 --> 00:14:59.990
Bring everyone who's free 
to the public pool now.

00:15:00.410 --> 00:15:02.520
No, not for picking up chicks!

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.330
We're gonna beat the crap out of a pervert!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.010
Next...

00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.160
Hey, lifeguard!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.010
What is it?

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:13.560
A friend of mine hasn't come out 
from under the water for a while.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:16.280
He might be drowning!

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.520
Please, save him!

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.600
What?!

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:27.580
Fools... They'll never find 
me in this crowd of people.

00:15:27.580 --> 00:15:29.280
Keep on searching all you want.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:33.290
Next, I just need to find 
Oga, then beat it outta here.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:35.840
Huh?

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:41.840
Where'd everyone go?

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.170
I found a Furuichi-kun!

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:51.970
Didn't you have a friend that was drowning?

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.930
Now, now... Just be quiet and watch!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.460
Furuichi, resign yourself.

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.430
You ain't got nowhere left to run.

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.440
All of a sudden there's a lot more of 'em.

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:12.480
You've been talking trash to the 
head of West High, Takashima-san!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:15.720
You better be prepared to 
accept the consequences.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:17.910
Don't think you can escape!

00:16:19.010 --> 00:16:20.640
Things have gotten dangerous.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.460
What should we do?

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:23.740
Just watch.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:26.760
But we're also kinda involved...

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:32.970
Yummy...

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.310
This is bad... What'll I do?

00:16:44.860 --> 00:16:45.850
Oga?!

00:16:45.850 --> 00:16:47.220
All right!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.880
With you here, we'll manage somehow!

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:50.560
Go get 'em!

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:58.420
Ha, no... Aloha...

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:02.070
Tropical island... Aloha...

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.370
Ha, ha-ha...

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:05.240
Get yourself together, Oga!

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:08.840
A gang with boards and 
bats are coming to get us!

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:14.450
A board in each hand, all aboard!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:18.890
Big guy, all aboard to aloha!

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:24.600
Looks like you can't rely 
on Oga like you always do!

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.400
It's over, Furuichi.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:33.870
Or maybe you'll grovel down in the pool!

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:35.410
For about, 10 minutes, say?!

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.710
There it is! Takashima-san 
is seriously twisted.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.510
I can't wait to see it!

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:41.040
What a show, baby!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.040
Sorry...

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:50.250
Huh?

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:51.730
You gonna apologize, now?

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.670
I didn't want to have to do this...

00:17:54.670 --> 00:17:56.120
What's that supposed to mean?

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:59.300
Are you an idiot?

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.490
You trying to bluff? Now?!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:02.700
What a show, baby!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.890
No, it's just... I'm sorry about 
using this really underhanded move.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.960
I'm counting on you, Baby Beel... Cry for me!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:48.420
Super Special Move!

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:52.790
Furuichi Rolling Thunder Blast!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:59.070
What just happened?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.870
Furuichi-kun... A word?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.040
Oh, you're awake?

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.450
Furuichi, you idiot!

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.010
I knew it!

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:28.280
Madame Aoi!

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.700
What have you been doing?

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.020
We were looking for you.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:33.750
Oh, well...

00:19:34.170 --> 00:19:36.670
Anyway, I heard that he's here?

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:37.390
He?

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:39.280
Yeah. Oga.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:43.030
Oga? I never said anything about Oga...

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:48.540
He and Furuichi were kicked out 
by the lifeguard a moment ago.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:55.270
Madame Aoi... That swimsuit...

00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:01.540
No!

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:02.960
D-Don't look!

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:10.060
I said I wanted something 
cute, and this was all they...

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.810
Cute!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:14.860
Damn that Furuichi!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:17.240
He can't have gotten far!

00:20:17.240 --> 00:20:18.600
Takashima-san...

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:20.530
Maybe we should just give up?

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.540
Shut up!

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.470
We were all burnt pretty good, right?

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:27.580
Ice-cream pops! Get your ice-cream pops!

00:20:23.470 --> 00:20:25.140
You just wanna let him go?

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:29.830
Hey, you!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:34.540
Did a brat with straight hair 
and a guy with an evil look

00:20:34.540 --> 00:20:37.090
and a naked baby on his back pass by here?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:40.090
Ice-cream pop? Here you go.

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:42.590
Did you hear me? Hey!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:48.890
It doesn't look like you're going to 
purchase some of my precious wares.

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.600
You're...

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:01.110
Ice-cream pops! How about 
some frozen ice-cream pops?

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.590
Frozen and sweet ice-cream pops!

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:47.050
This time, it's my stomach...

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:49.800
That's quite a tan-line you got.

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:55.700
Hilda-san!

00:22:57.850 --> 00:23:00.530
You're coming back already?

00:23:00.530 --> 00:23:05.120
Yeah. Thanks to a certain 
someone, we got kicked out...

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:06.800
I see.

00:23:07.200 --> 00:23:10.740
And after I went all the way to the 
Demon World to bring back a swimsuit...

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:11.820
Too bad.

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:13.330
Swimsuit?

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.210
Wait, this happened before.

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:22.330
Oh, I know... For Baby Beel, right?

00:23:22.330 --> 00:23:23.790
What are you talking about?

00:23:23.790 --> 00:23:25.340
This one is for adults only.

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.320
What?!

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:28.770
I understand, Hilda-san!

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:30.860
Then let's go to another pool straight away!

00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:31.920
Okay, okay?!

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:40.800
I will not let you!

00:23:46.140 --> 00:23:48.270
What do you, ah, think?

00:23:48.270 --> 00:23:50.070
It looks good on you, so go away, 'kay?

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:04.340
The Great Demon Lord has sent a 
wonderful present to the Master.

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:06.130
Now accept it gladly.

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:07.050
What's this?

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:11.420
A Demon morning-glory seed, Demon insect 
collecting kit, and seething notebook?

00:24:11.420 --> 00:24:13.180
It's summer homework.

00:24:15.550 --> 00:24:17.180
Baby Beel, you're excited about this?

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:20.350
On the next Beelzebub: How About 
Some Demon World Homework?

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:25.930
By the way, Demon World radio 
exercises go from 1 to 362509048.

00:24:25.930 --> 00:24:26.520
Will you do them?

00:24:26.520 --> 00:24:27.710
Hell, no.
